{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國知名演員崔佛岩曾於多部韓劇飾演男主角的父親而有「國民爸爸」之稱，他昨日因病離世，享年87歲。入行60年的崔佛岩，於1971年接拍首部韓劇《搜查班長》，之後在朱智勛與尹恩惠合作的人氣劇《宮》中扮演「聖祖皇帝」一角，前年曾在李帝勳主演的韓劇《搜查班長1958》中客串演出，深受韓劇迷愛戴。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T02:00:37.965005+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T01:48:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:38:54.960338+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T01:58:27.328344+00:00","content_hash":"f2487eb41f1726df061bb12af118d4d2d3f303e90f9d04fbfd3a671e386e51e4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T02:00:37.965005+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}